<title>TANZANIA: Tanzanian shilling steady on dollar-down on pound.</title>
<headline>Tanzanian shilling steady on dollar-down on pound.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzanian shilling remained unchanged against the dollar on Thursday but depreciated slightly against the pound, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The shilling exchanged at a commercial mean rate of 594.5742, and against the pound, it exchanged for 978.9694 compared to Wednesday's 977.4830.</p>
</text>
